{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"3ec251eeee66744aa2a880e657cae3fc61fbd19d3ae7f597f681ef41cb1712b8","ja":"なるな美也の一日","zh":"なる奈美也的一天","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"03e223d1a028e3294aa2927a904709291fa03f48142567aff40d5160115cc2c3","ja":"午前中のレッスンは終わりっと。\nほな、早速レッスンのこと投稿しよか。","zh":"上午的练习结束啦。\n那就赶紧发一条关于练习的动态吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0a1679cc859267d1b5e9780a5bd4174aed0ac9040fbe377ae2dd29adba325801","ja":"では、奈緒ちゃんを藍さん、歩さんをクロエさん\nとして……。こんな感じでどうでしょう～？","zh":"那么，把奈绪设定为蓝小姐，步设定为克洛伊小姐\n……。这样感觉如何呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"35fe36e9f0790f2303f2840a0ca9aa07bdaa4d0cc65556d9a419a0c3e85dfc35","ja":"「午前中は藍さんとクロエさんに\nダンスレッスンに付き合ってもらった」","zh":"“上午蓝小姐和克洛伊小姐\n陪我进行了舞蹈练习”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"23eb88ce56932fa0c05ed32616d816bf1cf7eb38a82d5817637cbdc144c593ba","ja":"「ふたりとも、やっぱり上手い。\n……少しでも早く追いつけるように、頑張らなきゃ」","zh":"「两个人果然都很厉害。\n……为了能尽早赶上她们，我必须努力才行」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e79ae308a725f68682e281f311d7e3d2e0811884f06f04b2f7cdcadb7c2e017f","ja":"うん、バッチリやな！\nこの調子で、どんどん投稿してこ！","zh":"嗯，完美！\n照这个劲头，多多发帖吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"da3d5866a582c1ce2e2347e10cf9e2c8fb74fc2a18620031e183ab30b3b9062d","ja":"SNSへの投稿は続いて……","zh":"继续发布到社交平台……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"5c1fa995cd3939d177f20e6fbc27981ecf7a94346a0231403dd7cf6e920cb1b2","ja":"むふふ。またまた、新しい投稿完了ですよ～♪","zh":"嘻嘻。又发了一条新的投稿哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ffaae4e735df5e47f60d4b1e3af8101a67765655634aea2d71f97401b519f59d","ja":"おっ、今度はなんて書いたん？","zh":"噢，这次写了什么呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"080479e749d4f1598e57f42de563c606f2913a21d94e927f5ce8b89c979b5ef6","ja":"「真珠星ちゃんが控え室でスマホを見ていた。\nもしかして、湊くんと連絡を……」","zh":"“真珠星在休息室看手机。\n难不成，是在和凑联络……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"1f06a3bca8804ad0258596fd53a76ddad3bf864ccce7fc717038592223f6fb7e","ja":"「と思ったら、ゲームをしていました。\nものすごく上手」","zh":"“正这么想着，结果发现她在玩游戏。\n技术超级好”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e73a14a25b4c89ccaf0354eeab167ed6464900305e17d6e0e267defc7554c899","ja":"ええやん！　やってることは杏奈そのままやけど、\n書き方ひとつで、真珠星っぽく見えるもんやなあ。","zh":"挺好的嘛！虽然做的事还是杏奈平时的样子，\n但换个写法，看着就很有真珠星的感觉了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"e8d733ef6424c1e150fb753ac89a86bb2bc6e56bfa5ee1c71a58ffdae0e66835","ja":"ファンのみなさんも、趣旨を理解して、\n楽しんでくれてるみたいですよ～♪","zh":"粉丝们似乎也理解了主旨，\n非常乐在其中呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"6016cd7cd7079843141a3010d9f91506aa0933b9df477c0d20783c7e56ddad52","ja":"でも、ここまで盛り上がってるんやったら、\n最後になんか、オチが欲しなってくるな……。　","zh":"不过，既然气氛都这么热烈了，\n最后总感觉还想要个包袱收尾呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1473.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"138b704459d769b4b81c00670c66c5abd46f3a3c16ae0aa990ce83fbf6088a71","ja":"なるほど、たしかにそうですな～。\nでは、ちょっと考えてみますね～。","zh":"原来如此，确实是这样呢～。\n那我就稍微考虑一下吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
